<section class="sec">
  <div class="wrap stack">
    <p class="eyebrow">Before anything else</p>
    <h2>Let's get the uncomfortable part out of the way.</h2>
    <div class="honest">
      <p><strong>You are probably wondering if this is a scam.</strong> You should be. After the program expanded, a lot of outfits started cold-calling families and knocking on doors on tribal land. The New Mexico Attorney General and the Tularosa Basin Downwinders Consortium both put out warnings about it. If someone has already called you about this out of nowhere, you were right to be suspicious.</p>
      <p><strong>You are probably wondering if we are the government.</strong> We are not. We are a private company. We are not the Department of Justice and we are not a law firm.</p>
      <p><strong>And you are probably wondering why anyone should pay for something you heard is free.</strong> Here is the honest answer. You can file this claim yourself, for free. RESEP clinics will help you for free. Plenty of people do it alone and do it fine. We are a paid convenience for families who would rather not gather forty years of records themselves, and we do not get paid unless the claim gets paid.</p>
      <p>If any of that means we are not for you, that is a completely reasonable place to land.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

